/* ------------------------------------------------------------------
   Visuals for this exercise, added beside the template styles.

   The two drag steps and the multi step carry one drawn icon per card,
   so each card reads as an object and not as a line of text. Each icon
   is a mask shape: the shape comes from the data URI, the colour comes
   from the text it sits beside. Only the alpha of the mask is used, so
   the paint inside the data URI never shows. Every colour here is a
   token, and every size comes from the spacing and type scales.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
